  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of Cukurova Delta Lagoons for Sustainable Conservation of Biodiversity in Adana (MSP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project proposal aims to protect and improve the biological diversity of the lagoons, which have an important share in marine fisheries and aquaculture, in parallel with the possible environmental damage and great loss of life, migration out of the region, loss of income of the people of the region and the search for new jobs in the earthquake region. The project will also focus on strengthening the lagoons which are among the most vulnerable ecosystems, against the effects of climate change, more resistant to economic, social and environmental pressures with new management models.</narrative>
  </description>
